| **M1-SCAF-02** | `quantforge.core` | Centralized seeded RNG utility using NumPy `Generator` with `PCG64` and `SeedSequence` | `[DOC_REPRO]` | Deterministic streams; parallel streams use `SeedSequence.spawn()`; no global seed | FAST unit test | NOT STARTED |
