| **M1-SCAF-04** | Test Harness | Pytest markers separating FAST unit tests from SLOW validation experiments | `[DOC_REPRO]` | `pytest -m fast` executes only fast tests; runtime budget proposal pending measurement | FAST unit test | NOT STARTED |
| **M1-MC-01** | Monte Carlo | Basic Monte Carlo estimator with CLT confidence interval construction on $E[S_T]$ | `[MATH_INVARIANT]` | CI boundaries algebraically correct: $[\hat{\mu} \pm z_{1-\alpha/2} S_N / \sqrt{N}]$ | FAST unit test | NOT STARTED |
| **M1-MC-02** | Monte Carlo | Repeated-experiment coverage test on known target $E[S_T] = S_0 e^{\mu T}$ (no options) | `[STAT_VALIDATION]` | Coverage across $R$ trials falls inside exact binomial band ($k \ge 192$ for $R=200$, $k \ge 979$ for $R=1000$ for $\alpha_{\text{fail}}=10^{-3}$) | SLOW experiment | NOT STARTED |
| **M1-BM-01** | Brownian Motion | Brownian motion path simulation with increment property checks | `[STAT_VALIDATION]` | Increments mean zero, variance $dt$, lag-1 correlation zero within budget-derived $z \times \text{SE}$ ($z \approx 3.29$) | FAST unit test | NOT STARTED |
| **M1-BM-02** | Brownian Motion | Quadratic variation experiment: $\sum (\Delta W)^2$ has mean $T$ and variance $2T^2/N$ | `[STAT_VALIDATION]` | Sample mean and sample variance match theoretical values within budget-derived $z \times \text{SE}$ ($z \approx 3.29$) | SLOW experiment | NOT STARTED |
| **M1-GBM-01** | Geometric BM | Exact analytical solution $S_t = S_0 \exp((\mu - 0.5\sigma^2)t + \sigma W_t)$ implementation | `[MATH_INVARIANT]` | Exact path evaluation matches formula to floating-point relative tolerance $10^{-12}$ | FAST unit test | NOT STARTED |
| **M1-GBM-02** | Geometric BM | Exact first and second moment checks: $E[S_T] = S_0 e^{\mu T}$, $E[S_T^2] = S_0^2 e^{(2\mu+\sigma^2)T}$ | `[STAT_VALIDATION]` | Sample moments over $P=10,000$ paths match analytical moments within budget-derived $z \times \text{SE}$ ($z \approx 3.29$) | FAST unit test | NOT STARTED |
| **M1-SDE-01** | SDE Solvers | Vectorized Euler-Maruyama and Milstein numerical solvers for 1D autonomous SDEs | `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` | Output shape, finite float64 values, interface compliance | FAST unit test | NOT STARTED |
| **M1-SDE-02** | SDE Strong Error | Strong convergence order experiment on 1D GBM driven by identical Brownian increments | `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` | Fitted slope agrees with exact strong error slope on $N \in \{16, 32, 64, 128, 256\}$ within $z \times \text{SE}$ ($z \approx 3.29$); informativeness $\text{SE} \le 0.05$ | SLOW experiment | NOT STARTED |
| **M1-SDE-03** | SDE Negative Control | Negative control test asserting test harness rejects deliberately wrong claimed order | `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` | Harness correctly raises failure when asserting order 1.0 for Euler-Maruyama | FAST unit test | NOT STARTED |
| **M1-SDE-04** | SDE Weak Reference | Deterministic weak error verification via exact second-moment recursions on GBM | `[MATH_INVARIANT]` | Log-log slope of error vs $h$ in $[0.90, 1.10]$ for both Euler and Milstein (analytical formula check; does NOT exercise solver code) | FAST unit test | NOT STARTED |
| **M1-SDE-05** | SDE Weak Solver Check | Numerical solver second moment sample mean agreement with discrete moment | `[STAT_VALIDATION]` | Sample mean $\overline{X_N^2}$ matches exact discrete moment $x_0^2 [f(h)]^N$ within $z \times S(X_N^2)/\sqrt{P}$ ($z \approx 3.29$, $\alpha_{\text{check}}=10^{-3}$) | SLOW experiment | NOT STARTED |
| **M1-ITO-01** | Itô Calculus | Pathwise algebraic identity $I_{\text{disc}} - 0.5(W_T^2-T) \equiv 0.5(T - \sum (\Delta W)^2)$ | `[MATH_INVARIANT]` | Identity holds on every simulated path within relative tolerance $10 \times \epsilon_{\text{mach}} \times M$ | FAST unit test | NOT STARTED |
| **M1-ITO-02** | Itô Calculus | Ensemble RMS error $\left\| I_{\text{disc}} - 0.5(W_T^2-T) \right\|_{L^2}$ scales as $\sqrt{T \Delta t / 2}$ | `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` | Fitted slope contains 0.5 inside budget-derived interval $[\hat{\text{slope}} \pm z \times \text{SE}]$ ($z \approx 3.29$); slope $\text{SE} \le 0.05$ | SLOW experiment | NOT STARTED |
