## 4. Phase-by-Phase Sign-off Checklist for Subsequent Phases (Phases 2 to 8)

### Phase 2: Financial Engineering & Option Pricing [CORE]
- [ ] `[MATH_INVARIANT]` `test_black_scholes.py`: Closed-form call/put prices satisfy Put-Call parity within $10^{-12}$.
- [ ] `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` `test_greeks.py`: Closed-form Greeks match numerical finite-difference derivatives within $10^{-4}$.
- [ ] `[STAT_VALIDATION]` `test_variance_reduction.py`: Measured VRF reported with empirical standard error from repeated batches; pilot measurement recorded.

### Phase 2 (Sub-phase 2.3): Educational Securitization Waterfall [STRETCH]
*(Separate gate; not required for Phase 2 CORE sign-off).*
- [ ] `[MATH_INVARIANT]` `test_securitization.py`: Collateral cash-flow conservation holds strictly across all tranches (`[STRETCH]` module).

### Phase 3: Statistical & Kernel Learning [CORE]
- [ ] `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` `test_regression.py`: Ridge and Lasso shrinkage paths trace expected coordinate descent trajectories.
- [ ] `[MATH_INVARIANT]` `test_kernels.py`: Mercer positive semi-definiteness verified for Linear, RBF, and Matérn Gram matrices ($\lambda_{\min} \ge -10^{-10}$).
- [ ] `[STAT_VALIDATION]` `test_gaussian_process.py`: Synthetic GP coverage matches nominal levels across independent datasets.
- [ ] `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` `test_gp_interpolation.py`: Exact GP posterior mean matches noise-free synthetic function within $10^{-4}$.

### Phase 4: Quantitative Research Protocol, EVT Risk & Tail Estimation [CORE]
- [ ] `[MATH_INVARIANT]` `test_walk_forward.py`: Chronological walk-forward splits verified with purging and embargo windows.
- [ ] `[MATH_INVARIANT]` `test_leakage_guard.py`: Synthetic look-ahead injection triggers immediate automated test failure.
- [ ] `[STAT_VALIDATION]` `test_multiple_testing.py`: Multiple testing adjustments control FWER/FDR within exact binomial bounds on synthetic noise.
- [ ] `[STAT_VALIDATION]` `test_heavy_tails.py`: Hill estimator on synthetic Pareto recovers true $\alpha$ within $z/\sqrt{k}$ tolerance ($z \approx 3.29$).
- [ ] `[STAT_VALIDATION]` `test_evt_fixtures.py`: Kupiec POF and Christoffersen likelihood ratio test statistics match numerical fixtures.
- [ ] `[EMP_HYPOTHESIS]` `exp02_evt_crash_backtest.md`: Unconditional and conditional EVT evaluated on historical crashes; limitations documented.

### Phase 5: Portfolio Optimization, Constraints & Transaction Costs [CORE]
- [ ] `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` `test_convex_opt.py`: Markowitz solver verifies KKT conditions with primal residual $\le 10^{-6}$ and status `OPTIMAL`.
- [ ] `[MATH_INVARIANT]` `test_markowitz_analytical.py`: Numerical solution matches 2-asset formula with $\sigma_{12}$ and boundary handling.
- [ ] `[MATH_INVARIANT]` `test_transaction_costs.py`: Adding transaction cost penalty monotonically reduces portfolio turnover.
- [ ] `[EMP_HYPOTHESIS]` `exp06_robust_vs_naive.md`: Robust Markowitz optimization compared out-of-sample against naive $1/N$ diversification.

### Phase 6: Bandits & Sequential Decision-Making [CORE & STRETCH]
- [ ] `[STAT_VALIDATION]` `test_mab.py`: UCB1 and Thompson Sampling exhibit cumulative pseudo-regret bounded by Auer et al. (2002) finite-time bound.
- [ ] `[MATH_INVARIANT]` `test_environment.py`: Financial trading MDP deducts transaction costs strictly according to schedule.
- [ ] `[MATH_INVARIANT]` `test_drl_portfolio.py`: PPO policy allocations project strictly onto probability simplex (`[STRETCH]`).
- [ ] `[EMP_HYPOTHESIS]` `exp05_risk_sensitive_bandits.md`: Worst 5% drawdown and CVaR of risk-sensitive bandits compared against UCB1 under heavy-tailed Pareto shocks.

### Phase 7: Modern AI: Attention, Transformers & Diffusion [STRETCH]
- [ ] `[MATH_INVARIANT]` `test_causality.py`: TCN and Transformer models pass zero-leakage causal gradient checks ($\partial y_t / \partial x_{t+k} \equiv 0$).
- [ ] `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` `test_diffusion_toy.py`: 1D temporal DDPM reproduces mean and variance on analytical Gaussian target within budget-derived $z \times \text{SE}$ ($z \approx 3.29$).
- [ ] `[EMP_HYPOTHESIS]` `exp04_diffusion_stylized_facts.md`: Statistical fidelity of generated scenarios evaluated on fat tails and volatility clustering; failure modes documented.

### Phase 8: Offline Dashboard & End-to-End Reproducibility [CORE]
- [ ] `[DOC_REPRO]` `test_dashboard_artifacts.py`: Dashboard successfully parses and renders real artifacts from all experiments without mock data.
- [ ] `[DOC_REPRO]` `test_full_replication.py`: Single master script executes end-to-end pipeline and reproduces all figures and metrics.
- [ ] `[DOC_REPRO]` `failed_hypotheses_registry.json`: All rejected hypotheses, degraded regimes, and ablation findings fully cataloged.
